  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1287/808/armory_full_1200_700-png.png\" alt=\"军械库 Logo\"></p>\n<h2>👑 史诗级护甲套装，拥有独特设计与套装奖励。</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模组加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-Spell_Engine-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Spell Engine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 探索更多 RPG 系列模组</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"法师\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"游荡者\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠宝\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"军械库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>📦 安装方式</h1>\n<h3>所需前置</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>弓箭手（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>圣骑士与牧师（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>游荡者与战士（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>法师（RPG 系列）</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>⭐️ 特性</h1>\n<p>本模组添加了高等级（终局）护甲套装，专门针对 RPG 系列模组的战斗职业设计。</p>\n<h2>📦 获取方式</h2>\n<p>从终局战利品宝箱（末地城、远古城市）及 Boss 掉落中获取“高级护甲升级”与“升级水晶”。</p>\n<p>使用它们将你的 RPG 系列职业护甲升级为史诗变体！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1374/877/armory_token-png.png\" alt=\"升级\"></p>\n<h2>👑 史诗级护甲套装</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>额外属性套装奖励</li>\n<li>法术修饰套装奖励</li>\n<li>独特的高质量模型，部分带有发光部件</li>\n<li>支持基础护甲纹饰（所有纹饰生成相同图案）</li>\n<li>美术风格遵循《我的世界：地下城》的美学</li>\n<li>灵感来源于经典 MMORPG 的著名套装 :)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1375/623/armory_updated-png.png\" alt=\"护甲套装\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1262/14/creative_tab-png.png\" alt=\"创造模式标签页\"></p>\n<h1>专为多人游戏打造</h1>\n<p>创建你自己的 RPG 服务器。使用我们的优惠码可享受更低价格，同时也能支持我们。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p>\n<h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1>\n<p>探索我们挚爱合作伙伴制作的丰富 Spell Engine 模组！</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"无政府\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"雇佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展包\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素法师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"力大师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
